{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "d4c610f7f44d12dff475227fc6b40e2f3594055fb35ae3480c0e66d7c9858aef", "ja": "聖母とギャルの…", "zh": "圣母与辣妹的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ff7a77cc85e65ced9098060f7c43a5e1fa1052a6f0ec22b24a2316f250b9f0e6", "ja": "公演の宣伝も兼ねて、ラジオ番組に出演する\nことになった朋花と恵美。そつなくトークと\n劇の宣伝をこなす。終了後、番組のスタッフ\nたちが「朋花様の子豚ちゃんになりたい」と\n言い出す。", "zh": "朋花和惠美要上广播节目顺便为公演宣传。\n两人发挥了优秀的谈话技巧，\n也为舞台剧做了很好的宣传。\n结束后，节目工作人员们表示：\n「想成为朋花大人的小猪」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "95e4a3536c387bd08492ac34f3ed00330b09d13be8421957988e3eefc3a33b38", "ja": "（今度の公演の宣伝もかねて、朋花と恵美が\nラジオ番組に出演することになった）", "zh": "（为了顺便帮这次的公演宣传，\n朋花和惠美要上一个广播节目。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5fa351fcedd8e77c3c3803dff7257c2247dfaafd309970854cdca8a73f5270fa", "ja": "（さて……そろそろふたりを連れて、\nラジオ局へ向かおうか）", "zh": "（那么……差不多该带她们去电台了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "f6e0a98fc533a22b79f475c2dc920a8e4206a68730a809e28fb05febf26a9ff2", "ja": "そーいえばさ。さっきエントランスに、\n朋花宛のフラスタが飾られてるの見たよ。", "zh": "话说啊～我刚刚在大厅，\n看到摆着要给朋花的花篮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c5124057fd382edb4e27a9154502160998d445fa905da2d64c387ec62bba780a", "ja": "ああ、俺も見たよ。\nずいぶん凝ったフラワースタンドだったな。", "zh": "嗯，我也看到了，\n那个花篮装饰得很用心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "43641c8f5cd6e74b524cc3026737d0d415997e52619653dc9f36ff41440cebcf", "ja": "そうそう！　子豚ちゃんのデザインでさ、\n超可愛かった！　思わず写真撮っちゃったよ～。", "zh": "对呀！设计成小猪的样子，超可爱的！\n我都忍不住拍下来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "b6dd731eaddbaa4b6bd15f29b7c2a3693457a014a386bd0458f646e8ed49d63f", "ja": "天空騎士団から贈られたものですね～。\n子豚ちゃん達、いい心がけです～♪", "zh": "大概是天空骑士团送的吧～\n小猪们很用心呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "32a28aada7fb969ccb7982100ad46026f2b89148661ca0923084de3591d923e8", "ja": "後で、騎士団の皆さんを\nほめてあげましょう～♪", "zh": "待会再来好好夸奖骑士团的大家吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "24adc8e1ba8876f055415931a01b3a5b0269ae4930662ab9fcc09838dd325259", "ja": "朋花って、ホント、\nファンから愛されてるよね～。", "zh": "朋花真的很受粉丝喜爱呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "138daaad9c3cccf006f4f3d625267395a768887e3142d6105da098bb1a416a06", "ja": "ふふっ。聖母ですから～♪", "zh": "呵呵，因为我是圣母呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "92debd3b1c469a616e63d21eade899512e89ff9e6862c8705968f0f7dd7d8b1a", "ja": "（そろそろラジオが始まる。台本は確認したが、\nラジオは生物……どうなるか楽しみだな）", "zh": "（广播节目就快要开始了。虽然已经先看过脚本了，\n但广播是现场直播……真期待她们会有什么样的表现。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1010_radikopersonality", "source_sha256": "2c1fdff6e3c83ed2c611c26204d4d2710184cee97181802656460e435bee17cc", "ja": "本日ゲストにお越しいただいたのは、\n765プロの所恵美さん、天空橋朋花さんです！", "zh": "今天的节目来宾是，\n765艺能的所惠美和天空桥朋花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1011_radikopersonality", "source_sha256": "013b7a1c7332c1f988f2cdb188abbdf75f89406858b4b7ac9fddafb9f50df747", "ja": "では、まず、おふたりに\n自己紹介をしていただきましょうか。", "zh": "那首先就请两位自我介绍一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "f738e6ed07df27b56f38114ef50cdd14312136f75c6f22f9cfdda05c0c793e23", "ja": "リスナーのみんな、やっほ！　所恵美だよ！\nアタシ、アイドルになる前はモデルやってたんだ。", "zh": "嗨，各位听众朋友！我是所惠美！\n我在成为偶像之前是模特儿喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "7cfc6ff99375bfc5bd73d783d802114563236b9a4d10edd99039173f6acd0af1", "ja": "好きなものはファミレスと、地元の所沢かな？\nにゃはは♪　今日はよろしくね、みんな！", "zh": "喜欢的东西是家庭餐厅，还有我的老家所泽吧？呀哈哈♪\n今天请大家多多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "6b621625ef76f0a2f9098a8ff41267ba487615c4beef1dc1111fb1784a336ddf", "ja": "リスナーの皆さん、ごきげんよう～♪\n天空橋朋花です～。", "zh": "各位听众朋友，你们好～♪\n我是天空桥朋花～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "a1824b58f327bff16baded2dff860aac11557e05724fb3fd15534b15d01c900d", "ja": "聖母の言葉を、一言たりとも、\n聞き逃してはいけませんからね～？", "zh": "请你们不要错过圣母所说的每一句话喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1016_radikopersonality", "source_sha256": "2f8e106d3c7ead89e3ca24a3cd64df8c2f4dfb3b4b2c7005bfae4251915ea42e", "ja": "聖母とギャル……。765プロは、\n個性豊かなアイドルが集まる事務所ですね！", "zh": "圣母跟辣妹……\n765艺能真是一间集合了形形色色偶像的事务所呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1017_radikopersonality", "source_sha256": "a2dbe7b66324cfd3d32fd34db1aab8448e491bfca521e8cbd9cfbba07b17e97e", "ja": "さて、この番組の今月のトークテーマは、\n『最近、ハマっているもの』……。", "zh": "那么，本节目这个月的对谈主题是\n『最近热衷的事物』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1018_radikopersonality", "source_sha256": "3d396ea8f7dd4d32c531a6727ced05838922a722c518c4e5b3c810700e8ca1b7", "ja": "天空橋さんは、今、\nハマってるものとかってありますか？", "zh": "天空桥小姐现在有什么热衷的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "e6a96bff63be0cf2c0e14d32ad3a0cb24bf34cb23ca8306dc6411c0195e6a06d", "ja": "読書でしょうか～♪　最近は百合子さんから\n借りた本を、空き時間に読んでいますよ～。", "zh": "大概是看书吧～♪\n我最近都利用空闲的时间，来看跟百合子借的书～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ea0dc17dd83f1dc079f6694ec6235ffb8199cd7a6ca1f8a3e0976d1004b35851", "ja": "（その後もふたりは、\nそつなくトークをこなしてみせた。そして……）", "zh": "（之后两个人发挥了优秀的谈话技巧。\n然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1021_radikopersonality", "source_sha256": "c655579aea0dbe9520beedc90299292800c323a06cc18227cd2fcc3b1d39c337", "ja": "さて……おふたりは次の765プロ劇場公演に、\n出演される予定だとか？", "zh": "接下来……\n听说两位预计将在下一次的765艺能剧场公演登台？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "8b35c0d26c8ae45540d03ce48dd05c69415d03c4e1ba9b0235e15418f6f8d853", "ja": "はい。初めての試みで、演劇メインの公演です～。\n私は、ヴァンパイアのクリスティーナを演じますよ～♪", "zh": "是的，这是我们初次尝试以戏剧为主的公演～\n我饰演的角色是吸血鬼克利丝汀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "8933627c4b92cab4df2660297da521594756b712e5ff067f48aff07212ab68d9", "ja": "アタシの役は、人間のエドガー！\nエドガーは、不器用だけどいいヤツでさ～。", "zh": "我的角色是人类艾德嘉！\n艾德嘉虽然很笨拙，但是个好人喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "2d585bdf8bf8d9cb1f4b1acd860349509b9bc1de8a3b94ff4a8df8dd7cbfcfa8", "ja": "不良に襲われたクリスを、かばったりするんだよね。\nそれでエドガーは……。", "zh": "他还去保护被流氓袭击的克利丝。\n然后艾德嘉就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "75f59f9884eee9422cba1d217a81f9f4949a735a800e799b5437b68d3c2d0338", "ja": "恵美さん～？　ネタバレはいけませんよ～？", "zh": "惠美～？不可以剧透喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "2e5c465f03a713007d17f7b2e28829f14be84c1d935f609634630d93109a78e0", "ja": "っと、そうだよ！　ごめ～ん！\nえと……、今の話は忘れてね、みんな！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "对喔！对不起～！\n呃……请大家忘记我刚刚讲的话！呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "344c5717dd082cc688e056edeb053074b3fa10495d971243527b4d4143c46f51", "ja": "とにかく、今回はかなりこう、なんてゆーか、\nダークな雰囲気？みたいな劇になると思うよ！", "zh": "总而言之，这次演的会是一出……怎么说呢？\n黑暗风格？的戏剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "e40578a0d93bf7f555ba5b8c5f33d85ca4bf8d607e5ce9152439962c59c4cdb9", "ja": "私達の劇場で本格的な劇を上演するのは、\n初めてのことになりますからね～。", "zh": "这也会是在我们的剧场里，\n第一次上演真正的舞台剧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "a7dd2a21a98ee07ca12ccc327ac4b84e680d393b0c682df2e1fc067193fc5be5", "ja": "そうそう。今までみんなが見たことのないアタシ達の\n顔を見せちゃうから、楽しみにしててよね♪", "zh": "没错没错，可以看到我们不同于以往的面貌，\n敬请期待喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "a119d91a9c0aec6a618d4c967e4d2fa29a305587abe83dc2ce98e9d728f2a81b", "ja": "『昏き星、遠い月』は、765プロ劇場で公演予定！\nリスナーのみんな、絶対に見に来てよね！", "zh": "『昏暗之星，遥远之月』预计在765艺能剧场进行公演！\n各位听众朋友一定要来看喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "94026cdda4195cb40c77f80e081c3ee206837dbda1c1c0c9e746ded5094fca4b", "ja": "観に来ない、悪い子豚ちゃん達には、\nおしおきですからね～？", "zh": "不来看的坏小猪们，\n就会被惩罚唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1032_radikopersonality", "source_sha256": "498fbfbb2536c0ae2f5d931a8e5b36910bbc5f2a0ee76def681b72d72de972bc", "ja": "公演の詳細については、\n765プロ公式ホームページをご覧ください！", "zh": "公演的详细资讯，\n请大家上765艺能官方网站查询！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1033_radikopersonality", "source_sha256": "75dbaefbb39ade39ceb4ecb07573412264f6ca7d796f17203f27ce0b8bba3f6d", "ja": "それでは、そろそろお別れのお時間となりました。\nでは、また来週。チャオ！", "zh": "那么节目也差不多接近尾声了。\n我们下周再见，Ciao！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "ee74c7c05fb7961bdfd72b793204bedbf70cbc0cdf8ddf4b190219b6959529b6", "ja": "恵美、朋花、お疲れさま！\n良いトークだったぞ。さ、帰ろうか。", "zh": "惠美、朋花，辛苦你们了！\n今天的谈话很棒喔。好了，我们回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1035_staff", "source_sha256": "b5db2abbc1dd94bc9f6aca46e196ee6e5fa8a498d7b4cad37b0acc74608b20a8", "ja": "あ、あのっ！", "zh": "那、那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1036_020meg", "source_sha256": "3e25c22cdb9852520991c584b5fa35b66c16fb43fa98abcef7c5728e38dec025", "ja": "あれっ？　えっと……さっきの番組の\nスタッフさんだよね？　どうしたの？", "zh": "咦？呃……你是刚刚节目的工作人员吧？\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1037_staff", "source_sha256": "bb636443ad7cfba9b5907f676768748884ba7ba986e0b4f78bb4152aea7c990c", "ja": "その……。さっきの番組で、お仕事をご一緒して……。\n天空橋さんのファンになりました！", "zh": "那个……刚刚在节目里跟您一起共事……\n让我成了天空桥小姐的粉丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1038_staff", "source_sha256": "fc5ced6d0a0b90e649c5c5a26f29dce085e811f41c41029c09e06533d0af8e87", "ja": "私を、子豚ちゃんにしてくれませんか、\n天空橋さん！　……いや、朋花様！", "zh": "可以让我成为您的小猪吗？天空桥小姐！\n……不，朋花大人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1039_staffb", "source_sha256": "6a2488d03ccfe8822db7c93587f0f6a605e06df57da6de9f40f5dd97f3efe608", "ja": "ぼ、ぼくも天空橋様の\n子豚ちゃんになりたいです！", "zh": "我、我也想成为天空桥大人的小猪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1040_staffc", "source_sha256": "9e59aa4ad8e4af4417d8edf7303828216b4408eed2073f687659605b79aae0a5", "ja": "自分も……！", "zh": "我也是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1041_031tom", "source_sha256": "9bc5af31bc1e7a7f1b519a0e74b27f71f7874fec2f4b328ff7b0225fbdf992c0", "ja": "ふふっ。子豚ちゃんになりたいと思えば、\nもう、アナタ達は子豚ちゃんなんですよ～♪", "zh": "呵呵，只要有想成为小猪的心，\n你们就已经是小猪了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1042_031tom", "source_sha256": "2e3ed346e703578d4ed6484bf6c8e1f3c28a20ce528d52108fbd04ddc3a3ae1a", "ja": "迷える子豚ちゃん達を導いてあげますから、\n安心して、私に尽くしてくださいね～♪", "zh": "我会引导迷途的小猪们，\n请安心地为我鞠躬尽瘁吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1043_stafftati", "source_sha256": "74f5c3c7c10c57771fd2a8a435be5b388e6ddd6693feb8a793fdd47bb012db32", "ja": "は、はいっ！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "f761252a19a6bf42822d38b0a882b0b47ee8f06ed2af9c3ea3e236b37b9c3c0b", "ja": "ふわぁ～、また子豚ちゃんが増えちゃったね。\nやっぱスゴいな～、朋花は。", "zh": "哇～小猪又增加了。\n朋花真的好厉害～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "9dbf14a00d36493333448d7e4e36514e28e119c15b88c5e70ec9e916b6afdf83", "ja": "ああ。相変わらず、\nとんでもないカリスマだ……。", "zh": "是啊，一如往常的惊人魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "7beeee71d07395b709aacc2c38a5c820c82dcd3148a62a3102e5e4003cb7b2eb", "ja": "（あっという間に人を魅了する朋花は、\nある意味、ヴァンパイアに似ているのかもな……）", "zh": "（转眼间就让众人为之臣服的朋花，\n就某种意义上来说，也挺像吸血鬼的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
